description:
This is a combined synopsis/solicitation for commercial construction prepared in accordance with the format in FAR Part 12. This announcement constitutes the only solicitation; quotes are being requested, and a separate written solicitation will not be issued.&nbsp; 

Solicitation number 1240LU27Q0001 is issued as a Request for Quotation (RFQ) for the Powell Duplex Improvements on the Nez Perce &ndash; Clearwater National Forest. 

The project consists of removing and replacing the existing roof(s), water damaged Structurally Insulated Panels (SIP), some structural members in the roof and walls of an existing residential duplex.&nbsp; The existing demolished materials shall be disposed of off Forest Service lands in accordance with all State and federal laws. 

This acquisition&nbsp;is set-aside for small business concerns. The applicable North American Industry Classification System Code is   236118 .  The small business size standard is&nbsp;  $45 Million.   This acquisition is a total Small Business set-aside.&nbsp;&nbsp; All responsible sources may submit a quotation which will be considered by the agency.&nbsp; 

Amendment 01 - Summary: Due date for quotes is extended.&nbsp; Period of Performance is changed.
